msgstr "<i>홍수 속의 자갈</i>에서 아무 적 대장이나 무찔러라."

#. [achievement_group]
#: data/campaigns/The_South_Guard/achievements.cfg:24
msgid "Scenario 5b: Probably Improbable"
msgstr "시나리오 5b: 아마도 불가능"

#. [achievement_group]
#: data/campaigns/The_South_Guard/achievements.cfg:25
msgid "Complete the campaign after playing <i>Into the Depths</i>."
msgstr "<i>심연으로</i>를 플레이한 후 캠페인을 완료하라."

#. [achievement_group]
#: data/campaigns/The_South_Guard/achievements.cfg:25
msgid "Scenario 5c: Rocks Fall, Everyone Dies"
msgstr "시나리오 5c: 바위가 떨어지고 모두가 죽는다"

#. [achievement_group]
#: data/campaigns/The_South_Guard/achievements.cfg:26
